  "finding": "The pretrained saliency model improves several whole-heart outlines. Two additional unresolved photos yield checked approximate pairs, but their lower tips are outside the photo. The frozen all-corners-observed fallback selects neither. Existing production already allows some partially observed proposals; a review-required partial-photo fallback is a separate development policy to test prospectively.",
  "scoring": "Observed-area errors exclude unseen pixels. Older foreground-replay whole-square errors, which included padding, are retained beside them. Exact saved geometry was reused and source/target hashes verified; there was no refit during editable QA.",
  "visualReview": {
    "fields": "All sixteen RGB/body comparisons inspected in four sheets; whole-heart silhouettes often improve. Cream paper on pale background, reflective silver/gold, and some green/white designs still fail. Handles are sometimes included.",
    "exports": "All three source/crop/mask/export comparisons inspected. See per-case notes. Small derived-mask errors do not certify intended artwork or original cutting paths.",
    "sheet": "tmp/heart-learning/u2netp-pipeline-v1/export-contact-sheet.png"
  },
  "limitations": [
    "This sixteen-photo cohort has already been inspected; these are development results, not a fresh held-out test.",
    "Photos come from a single board/source group; motif novelty is unverified.",
    "Upstream pretraining overlap with public photos is unknown.",
    "Native CPU only. Publisher skimage preprocessing has not yet been validated in browser inference.",
    "Saliency scores are per-image normalized, not calibrated paper probabilities.",
    "Two partial-photo pairs meet computational checks but were not physically cut or assembled."
  ],
